==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*kweþaną}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*gʷet-}} (compare {{cog|cel-pro|*bet-lo-||mouth}} in {{cog|sga|bél}}). Cognate with {{cog|ofs|qwetha}}, {{cog|osx|quethan}}, {{m|osx|queþan}}, {{cog|odt|quethan}} ({{cog|dum|quedden}}), {{cog|goh|quedan}}, {{cog|non|kveða}} ({{cog|is|kveða}}, {{cog|da|kvæde}}, {{cog|sv|kväda}}), {{cog|got|𐌵𐌹𐌸𐌰𐌽}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkweθɑn/|lang=ang}}

